'''Barnacles''' is a stackable [[debuff]] that convert a percentage of the target's [[physical damage]] to [[cold damage]] and increases the duration of [[chill]] and [[freeze]] on them.

==Mechanics==
Each stack of Barnacles applies {{c|mod|Converts 5% of Physical Damage to Cold Damage}} and {{c|mod|5% increased Duration of Chill and Freeze on You}}. Barnacles can stack up to 10 times and last 30 seconds.

Similar to the stats found on {{il|Kaom's Binding}} and {{psl|Shaper of Flames}}, Barnacles converts the enemy's physical damage and is different from [[damage taken]] conversion.

